Create a Custom Dashboard
                      NAVIGATE
                              Dashboards
                                → New Dashboard
                                → Add Visualization
                                  Prometheus
Create CPU Utilization Gauge- CPU Utilization %
                              PromQL - 100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle"}[5m])) * 100) ,  Visualization - Gauge , Settings - Unit = Percent (0-100) , Thresholds - Green  = 0-60, Yellow = 60-80, Red    = 80-100 , TitleCPU Utilization %  SAVE

Create Memory Utilization Gauge
          Query: PromQL- 100 * (1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes))
                                                        Visualization:  Gauge
                                                        Unit: Percent
                                                        Thresholds: Green = 0-70 Yellow = 70-85 Red = 85-100
                                                        Title: Memory Utilization %  Save.


Create Disk Utilization Gauge
          Query: PromQL- 100 - ((node_filesystem_avail_bytes * 100)node_filesystem_size_bytes)

                                                        Visualization:  Gauge
                                                        Unit: Percent
                                                        Thresholds: Green = 0-70 Yellow = 70-85 Red = 85-100
                                                        Title: Disk Usage % %  Save.

